    "diagramHtml": "\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"diagram-header\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-badge\">BATCH 02 VISUAL GUIDE — POLE 1</div>\n    <h4>The aissistant: a small honest agent, and the seam waiting to be filled</h4>\n    <p>Persona is three strings; capability is six methods; failure is typed; and the tenant-scoped toolset is a wiring task, not a redesign</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diagram-svg-container\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 350\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arr-02\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrg-02\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrr-02\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <g transform=\"translate(20, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">PERSONA = 3 STRINGS</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">role · goal · backstory</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">base_agent.py:256-258</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Identity is a frozen uuid</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#b45309\">No name/tenant/lifecycle</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(245, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">CAPABILITY = 6 METHODS</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">base_agent.py:668-701</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">executeTask · aexecuteTask</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">createExecutor · 3 tool getters</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">A complete agent contract</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(470, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE LOOP IS ReAct</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Text reasoning by default</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Native tool-calling is an OPTIMISATION</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">crew_agent_executor.py:352/:505</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">Model-agnostic by design</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(695, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"205\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">FAILURE IS TYPED</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Structured data + retryable flag</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">tool_failure.py:35-71</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Escalates tool→task→agent→crew</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">Answers \"tool broke, now what\"</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"190\" width=\"880\" height=\"140\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#2563eb\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"218\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">THE MOST ACTIONABLE FINDING: the tool filter already takes a run context — and nothing fills it</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"244\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">ToolFilterContext(agent, server_name, run_context) — mcp/filters.py:17-35 — receives everything a tenant-scoped toolset would need.</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"264\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">The seam exists, is well-shaped, and is unpopulated. A tenant-scoped toolset is therefore a WIRING task for us — not a redesign of the agent.</text>\n      <rect x=\"40\" y=\"282\" width=\"840\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#10b981\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\"/>\n      <text x=\"52\" y=\"303\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#059669\">But: an agent is a VALUE OBJECT, not a record — no persistence, no tenancy, no org, no lifecycle. That half is ours.</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
