    "diagramHtml": "\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"diagram-header\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-badge\">BATCH 04 VISUAL GUIDE — POLE 3</div>\n    <h4>Automations: an excellent executor with no delivery layer</h4>\n    <p>Work does not arrive in CrewAI — it is started. What it does give is a declared workflow graph and a credible durability store</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diagram-svg-container\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 380\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arr-04\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrg-04\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrr-04\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"880\" height=\"58\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ef4444\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"46\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">THE HEADLINE: no scheduler, no queue, no worker, no clock — measured by direct search, not inferred.</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"66\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Redis appears only as a lock and a cache, never a job broker. Work runs when a developer's process calls kickoff().</text>\n\n      <g transform=\"translate(20, 95)\">\n        <rect width=\"285\" height=\"165\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">WHAT IS ABSENT</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• no queue / broker / worker pool</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• no cron, scheduler or clock</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• no retry, backoff or expiry</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• no ownership of pending work</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">A paused run nobody resumes stays paused.</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(320, 95)\">\n        <rect width=\"285\" height=\"165\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#047857\">WHAT IS GENUINELY GOOD</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• Flow: a declared method graph</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• or_ / and_ with first-wins racing</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• Progress = a set of completed names</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• plot() → standalone HTML</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">The graph is executed AND drawn.</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(620, 95)\">\n        <rect width=\"280\" height=\"165\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">THE DURABILITY STORE</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• @persist: append-only rows</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• CheckpointConfig: whole-run snapshots</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• resume / fork(branch=…)</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• restored run gets a FRESH id</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#b45309\">…but the engine FORBIDS combining them.</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <g transform=\"translate(20, 278)\">\n        <rect width=\"430\" height=\"88\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE ONE \"WAIT FOR THE OUTSIDE\" PRIMITIVE</text>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"48\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">A pending_feedback row plus from_pending(flow_id).resume(text) —</text>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"66\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">whose own docstring names a webhook handler as the caller,</text>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"82\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#b45309\">because nothing in CrewAI does.</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <g transform=\"translate(470, 278)\">\n        <rect width=\"430\" height=\"88\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">THE RACING RULE WORTH COPYING</text>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"48\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Only exclusively-fed alternatives race. Cancelling a member of an</text>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"66\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">and_ would make it unsatisfiable forever — the source documents it</text>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"82\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">in its own comment. Non-obvious, already correct.</text>\n      </g>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
