    "diagramHtml": "\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"diagram-header\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-badge\">BATCH 05 VISUAL GUIDE — WIDGETS &amp; FRONTEND</div>\n    <h4>An empty frontend, and the only real widget architecture found in the study</h4>\n    <p>A2UI: a four-message protocol, an 18-component typed catalogue, and a permission rule enforced on the way OUT</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diagram-svg-container\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 350\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arr-05\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrg-05\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrr-05\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <g transform=\"translate(20, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"145\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">THERE IS NO FRONTEND</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">No package.json, no bundler</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">No JS or TS anywhere</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">No HTML app, no renderer</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">The whole layer is ours</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(245, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"145\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">A2UI — 4 MESSAGES</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">BeginRendering · SurfaceUpdate</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">DataModelUpdate · DeleteSurface</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">models.py:106/123/134/148</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">A render tree + data model</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(470, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"145\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">18 TYPED COMPONENTS</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Ordinary UI primitives</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Bindings, composition, actions</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Data addressed by path (BoundValue)</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">A bounded, closed vocabulary</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(695, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"205\" height=\"145\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#b45309\">PROMPT-AUGMENTED</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">inject_tools is a no-op</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">The UI request rides in the prompt</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">client_extension.py:212-213</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#b45309\">A deliberate choice, not tool calls</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"185\" width=\"430\" height=\"145\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#10b981\" fill-opacity=\"0.09\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"213\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#047857\">THE KEY IDEA: allowed_components enforced on the RESPONSE</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"239\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">A widget subset is not merely advertised in the prompt — it is checked</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"259\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">when the answer comes back (client_extension.py:397, :426).</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"283\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#059669\">This is the only real enforcement mechanism found anywhere in the study.</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"311\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-muted, #64748b)\">Two protocol generations sit side by side; their deltas are the design decisions.</text>\n\n      <g transform=\"translate(470, 185)\">\n        <rect width=\"430\" height=\"145\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n        <text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE OTHER SURFACES (all outside the web)</text>\n        <text x=\"20\" y=\"54\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• A 3,278-line terminal TUI — a live subscriber to the event bus</text>\n        <text x=\"20\" y=\"76\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• flow.plot() — draws the flow from the same definition it runs</text>\n        <text x=\"20\" y=\"98\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• A Mintlify docs site it does not build</text>\n        <rect x=\"20\" y=\"112\" width=\"390\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" fill-opacity=\"0.10\"/>\n        <text x=\"28\" y=\"126\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Take the vocabulary + the subsetting rule. Build the renderer and the frontend.</text>\n      </g>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
