    "diagramHtml": "\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"diagram-header\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-badge\">BATCH 06 VISUAL GUIDE — OUT-OF-POLE (PZ)</div>\n    <h4>The tenancy question, closed — and the surfaces that still matter</h4>\n    <p>Three of the four purposes a tenancy model is made of are literal TODOs in the shipped source</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diagram-svg-container\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 350\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arr-06\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrg-06\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrr-06\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"880\" height=\"120\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ef4444\" fill-opacity=\"0.07\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"48\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">SecurityConfig — 274 lines across four files, and its own docstring admits the gaps</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"74\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• Authentication credentials … *TODO*  (security_config.py:25)</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"94\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• Scoping rules … *TODO*  (:27)          • Impersonation / delegation tokens … *TODO*  (:28)</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"118\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">The only field that exists is fingerprint — who you are, what you may see, acting for someone: all unimplemented.</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"134\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-muted, #64748b)\">Those three ARE a tenancy model. The word \"tenant\" appears in twelve files; not one is a tenancy model.</text>\n\n      <g transform=\"translate(20, 155)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"175\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#047857\">IDENTITY (the one that IS built)</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Dual id: readable name + uuid</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">fingerprint.py:41-50</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Random by default</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">DETERMINISTIC from a seed (uuid5)</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">Stable identity, no database</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(245, 155)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"175\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#b45309\">AUTH WITHOUT AUTHORIZATION</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Five pure OAuth providers</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">base_provider.py:10-46</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">They log you IN</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Nothing decides what you may DO</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#b45309\">No roles, no scopes, no policy</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(470, 155)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"175\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">TELEMETRY & THE ENTERPRISE</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">OTLP, opt-out</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">A checkable privacy claim in-source</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">telemetry.py:1-9</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Enterprise = a token vs a remote service</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">Not data partitioning</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(695, 155)\">\n        <rect width=\"205\" height=\"175\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">THE UNUSED SEAM</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">ToolFilterContext is well-shaped</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">mcp/filters.py:17-26</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">and unpopulated</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">A tenant would go here</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">A wiring task for us</text>\n      </g>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
